mily: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 선발 인원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 한국 1명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 장학 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 10개월</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 장학 조건</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 월생활비 : 450유로(?) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 학비 무료 (어학 연수시에는 연수비 본인 부담)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 지원 자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 한국 국적 소지자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 석(박)사과정: 만 41세 미만 (1973년 1.1 이후 출생자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 학사(석사) 학위 소지자 (그리스에서의 대학원 시작일 기준) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 그리스어 구사능력이 있고,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 그리스정부장학금 수혜를 받은 적이 없는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">바. 그리스정부 또는 유럽연합 장학금을 받고 있지 않은 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 지원 서류 및 기타 사항: 붙임 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.그리스정부초청장학생 선발요강(국문) 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1-1.140203_upotrofies_en 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2.지원서(본원 양식) 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 3. 지원서140203_upotrofies_en_app 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 4. 2013 그리스 지원자 DB양식 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 5.서약서 1부. 끝.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
